# Human-authored development/test dependency intent.
# The pinned lockfile `requirements-dev.txt` is GENERATED from this file:
#
#   pip-compile requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# `-c requirements.txt` constrains dev deps to the same versions the production
# lockfile resolved, so the two lockfiles can be installed together without
# conflict. Compile on Python 3.14 (matches Render). See docs/dependencies.md.
#
# Note: `nox` is intentionally NOT listed here — it manages the test venv from the
# outside and must live in the outer dev/CI environment, not inside the venv it
# builds. Install it ad hoc: `pip install nox`.

-c requirements.txt

pytest
pytest-asyncio
pytest-cov
httpx
pip-tools
